{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-7-25","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：素数与互素与整数","englishTitle":"If two numbers be prime to one another, the product of one of them into itself will be prime to the remaining one.","book":7,"number":25,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.25","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.25/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":25,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-7-25@raw-9bb92500189fb09d","contentId":"euclid-7-25","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9bb92500189fb09ddc2184f5acfbb8bc63e021940e0c5cb474d5a8b06ab71a67","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-7-25.statement","euclid-7-25.construction.1","euclid-7-25.construction.2","euclid-7-25.proof.1","euclid-7-25.proof.2","euclid-7-25.proof.3","euclid-7-25.conclusion","euclid-7-25.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-7-25.statement","contentId":"euclid-7-25","revisionId":"euclid-7-25@raw-9bb92500189fb09d","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"85693a962cddee06484c7ae55bc5f0f7a63bdb1417be3d4be5fdfe8edc5bf02a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If two numbers be prime to one another, the product of one of them into itself will be prime to the remaining one."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果两个数字是互素, 其中之一的产物本身将是其余一个的产物。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-25.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-7-25","revisionId":"euclid-7-25@raw-9bb92500189fb09d","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3106b8a84f133666c8f2d13f05046fc6031a47991d1729560b7c978a6ca266a8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let A, B be two numbers prime to one another, and let A by multiplying itself make C: I say that B, C are prime to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让A,B成为2号互素, 让A乘以C,我说B,C是互素。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-25.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-7-25","revisionId":"euclid-7-25@raw-9bb92500189fb09d","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e3e614e918ed6a40acb63373a3fdb69ca65ef4ea8587355c9eaf633609f68dc2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let D be made equal to A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"D等于A, D等于A, D等于D, D"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-25.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-7-25","revisionId":"euclid-7-25@raw-9bb92500189fb09d","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3b11aac32c490f0a7fd6caf741240b61d8b6c8169ea18529361486da2fd29310","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since A, B are prime to one another, and A is equal to D, therefore D, B are also prime to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于A,B为互素,A等于D,因此D,B也等于互素。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-25.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-7-25","revisionId":"euclid-7-25@raw-9bb92500189fb09d","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9ad3968d8b040905a458bf6ec34218ef5139393358864ec106f061554ead11a0","citations":["euclid-7-24"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore each of the two numbers D, A is prime to B; therefore the product of D, A will also be prime to B. [[VII. 24](/principles/euclid-7-24)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,这两个数字中的每一个D,A是B的原始数字;因此,D,A的产物也将是B的原始数字。 [[VII. 24](/principles/euclid-7-24)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-25.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-7-25","revisionId":"euclid-7-25@raw-9bb92500189fb09d","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6d7eb5ef77c444d9cc6a916747002005276f1707a89584613638b8f3644f4348","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the number which is the product of D, A is C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但D,A的产物是C"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-25.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-7-25","revisionId":"euclid-7-25@raw-9bb92500189fb09d","order":6,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6a5dcffe8f94721db99092a889a9d0f8a480af9a0c2c5ed4849970a6e52b1127","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore C, B are prime to one another. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,C,B是互素。 Q. E,D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-25.source","contentId":"euclid-7-25","revisionId":"euclid-7-25@raw-9bb92500189fb09d","order":7,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b67f2b37bb180f1e9b1e508fbadb239e9c9c9e767f4fabaa9785b74b2d5829dd","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.25/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.pr